<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Pioneer Valley Tennis Matchmaker</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="navbar">
    <span class="logo">PV Tennis</span>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Pioneer Valley Tennis Matchmaker</h1>
    <p>Find local hitting partners at your skill level and with a schedule that works for you.</p>
    <a href="/profiles" class="btn">Find a Partner</a>
  </section>

  <main>
    <h2 class="section-title">How It Works</h2>
    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature">
        <h3>Make a Profile</h3>
        <p>Add your age, how long you've played, when you're free, and your USTA rating or ranking if you have one.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <h3>Search for Players</h3>
        <p>Look up players by name, filter by an exact USTA rating, or set a max ranking to find people at your level.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <h3>Get on the Court</h3>
        <p>Reach out to players whose availability matches yours and set up a time to hit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="card who">
      <h2>Who It's For</h2>
      <p>Recreational players, junior athletes, and campus clubs around Amherst and the Pioneer Valley. You don't need a USTA rating to sign up.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>CS326 Group Project - William Bae, Edelson Garcia, Alexandria Anderson</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
